    {
      "day": 13,
      "line": "📖 Luz is walking Chloe through the broad smooth green leaves in spring colonies, strong onion smell when crushed — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour."
    },
    {
      "day": 18,
      "line": "Katarina leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Lockpick. Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 18,
      "line": "💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Lockpick: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 18,
      "line": "📓 Codex: Counter: Buy it off — It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase."
    },
    {
      "day": 28,
      "line": "They're named, every one: Cole Cohen, Ibrahim Reyes, Lucia Novak. Your move — ask them questions (up to three), call a MOOT on it, or turn them away at the edge of the firelight."
